OL,3,GNEWSAKey takeaways from BBC interview
OL,4,Aas Earl Spencer defends claims about
OL,5,AKing
OL,6,
OL,7,FEarl Spencer has told the BBC writing
OL,8,Fhis book about sister Princess Diana,
OL,9,Fwhich has made headlines for its
OL,10,Fcriticism of King Charles, was his
OL,11,F"duty...as an eyewitness to history".
OL,13,FIn an interview with the BBC's Laura
OL,14,FKuenssberg ahead of the memoir's
OL,15,Frelease on Tuesday, Earl Spencer said
OL,16,Fhe wanted "to put things down once and
OL,17,Ffor all that were true".
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
